WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:05.880
What if switching analytics platforms didn't take a year?

2
00:00:06.750 --> 00:00:11.550
What if you could go faster, cheaper, and with more accuracy?

3
00:00:12.750 --> 00:00:18.663
That's our promise at BI Migrations: faster, cheaper, and more accurate than anyone else.

4
00:00:18.713 --> 00:00:20.740
Let me show you how we keep it.

5
00:00:21.950 --> 00:00:24.409
Step one: create your account.

6
00:00:24.459 --> 00:00:26.750
It takes about five seconds.

7
00:00:27.550 --> 00:00:31.889
Then your Dashboard lays out the whole journey, in eleven simple steps.

8
00:00:31.939 --> 00:00:33.620
You always know what's next.

9
00:00:35.050 --> 00:00:37.858
Your estate scan is completely free.

10
00:00:37.908 --> 00:00:40.160
All you sign is a mutual NDA.

11
00:00:40.950 --> 00:00:41.693
Now watch.

12
00:00:41.743 --> 00:00:53.740
Estate Scanner reads your entire estate, read-only, on your own machine: datasets, dataflows, cards, dashboards, calculations, and how they all connect.

13
00:00:54.750 --> 00:00:57.125
It helps us give you an accurate quote.

14
00:00:57.175 --> 00:00:59.860
But it also tells you things you never knew.

15
00:01:00.750 --> 00:01:01.980
Cards nobody opens.

16
00:01:02.030 --> 00:01:03.799
Dependencies nobody mapped.

17
00:01:03.849 --> 00:01:05.550
Dataflows quietly failing.

18
00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:11.209
In one large estate we scanned, more than half the cards sat on no dashboard at all.

19
00:01:11.259 --> 00:01:14.914
That's a lot of dead weight to carry to a new platform.

20
00:01:14.964 --> 00:01:17.070
Now you'll know before you move.

21
00:01:18.750 --> 00:01:22.900
Skip the clutter, and you migrate less, faster, and for less.

22
00:01:24.550 --> 00:01:27.740
When you're ready, send your scan to us with a single click.

23
00:01:28.750 --> 00:01:32.549
We study it, and send you a clear migration quote.

24
00:01:32.599 --> 00:01:33.550
No guesswork.

25
00:01:35.250 --> 00:01:37.276
Then BIMControl takes over.

26
00:01:37.326 --> 00:01:41.660
Migrate one dashboard, or your entire estate, end to end.

27
00:01:42.450 --> 00:01:51.090
It rebuilds your data, your logic and your visuals on the new platform, and then it proves it, element by element, with parity checks.

28
00:01:52.650 --> 00:01:57.760
Every element gets a status and a reason, so there are no surprises on go-live day.

29
00:02:00.650 --> 00:02:02.634
And you're never on your own.

30
00:02:02.684 --> 00:02:11.122
A migrations lead from BI Migrations works through every gap, to give you one-to-one parity, as far as technology allows.

31
00:02:11.172 --> 00:02:15.050
Because a migration is about trust, not just technology.

32
00:02:16.450 --> 00:02:27.525
BI Migrations is a service as software that helps you migrate, or decide which target BI platform to migrate to, swiftly, accurately, and with zero friction.

33
00:02:27.575 --> 00:02:29.580
Let the parity checks decide.

34
00:02:30.850 --> 00:02:34.633
Start with your estate.

35
00:02:34.683 --> 00:02:36.300
It's free.
